Bind Npc 24435 Zone 1 for karus
Bind Npc 14435 Zone 2 for elmorad
Quest 516 "[Descendant of Hero] Festival Preparation"
    Journal for karus "You must talk to [Secret Agent] Clarence from Belua Village."
    Journal for elmorad "You must talk to [Secret Agent] Clarence of Asga Village."

Requires player level >= 60

Rewards none

On available
    If player is karus
        Say "Master, [Moradon Merchant] Shaimer is looking for you. Go ahead and visit him, please."
        Topic "All right, I'll swing by" goto close
    If player is elmorad
        Say "Master, [Moradon Merchant] Clark is looking for you. Go ahead and visit him, please."
        Topic "All right, I'll swing by" goto close

On offer
    If player is karus
        Say "Hello <selfname>! Long time no see! Ha, ha, ha. What are you looking for today?"
        Topic "Tell me more..." do
            Show quest "Not sure if you know but we will be opening a party for the king's grace to thank him! Please help us prepare for the celebration!\n\n[Moradon Merchant] Shaimer  has asked to help [Secret Deputy] Clarence for the celebration preparation."
    If player is elmorad
        Say "Hello <selfname>! Long time no see! Ha, ha, ha. What are you looking for today?"
        Topic "Tell me more..." do
            Show quest "Not sure if you know but we will be opening a party for the king's grace to thank him! Please help us prepare for the celebration!\n\n[Moradon Merchant] Clark has asked to help [Secret Deputy] Clarence for the preparation of celebration."

On claimable
    Show quest "You will help us? Thank you! So for now, please visit [Secret Agent]Clarence. He will send the needed food for the festival!"

On completed
    If player is karus
        Say "[Secret Agent]Clarence is in Bellua Village. Thanks for you cooperation."
    If player is elmorad
        Say "[Secret Agent]Clarence is in Asga Village. Thanks for you cooperation."
